msgctxt "132"
msgid "Is this Kazuma Kiryu?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "144"
msgid "It is. Who's asking?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "156"
msgid "This is the Minister of Defense. Tamiya."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "168"
msgid "Tamiya!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "192"
msgid ""
"As you're aware, I had been in contact with Daigo Dojima\r\n"
"regarding the proposed Okinawa deal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid "Yeah. Your secretary Toma told me all about it a year or so ago."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "228"
msgid "Right. Unfortunately, after Daigo Dojima was shot..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "240"
msgid ""
"The Suzuki-supporting members of the Tojo Clan flung into\r\n"
"overdrive attempting to push the resort."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid ""
"In turn, I had no choice but to ensure my military expansion\r\n"
"bill passed as well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "276"
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "288"
msgid ""
"I thought the resort started back up because you tried to\r\n"
"pass your bill, not the other way around."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "300"
msgid ""
"Not exactly. My attempts to see the military expansion bill\r\n"
"passed were the result of a third party. My hand was forced."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "312"
msgid "And what does any of this have to do with me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "324"
msgid "I need you to do me a favor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "336"
msgid "Keep the resort from starting up again?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "348"
msgid ""
"Not quite. Though the end result will ultimately lead to\r\n"
"that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "360"
msgid ""
"I'm not sure I follow. Aren't your base and that resort some\r\n"
"kind of linked pair?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "372"
msgid "If the resort doesn't happen, neither will your base."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "384"
msgid "This matter is regrettably not as simple as that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "396"
msgid ""
"Regardless, if you still want to put a stop to this resort\r\n"
"deal, come to my office in the Diet Building."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "408"
msgid "The Diet Building, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "420"
msgid ""
"You heard me. I'll have my driver wait for you in front of\r\n"
"the Millennium Tower. He'll bring you to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "432"
msgid "Fine. I have a few questions of my own that could use answering."
msgstr ""

